WEBVTT

00:01:57.738 --> 00:02:00.867
Now, Harvard University studies
among Black Americans

00:02:00.908 --> 00:02:05.288
living in areas like Harlem
and the South Bronx,

00:02:05.329 --> 00:02:08.457
those are communities
which do not need clean air standards

00:02:08.499 --> 00:02:11.419
set by the Environmental
Protection Agency.

00:02:11.419 --> 00:02:13.462
And those studies that found

00:02:13.462 --> 00:02:16.799
that Black Americans have died of COVID-19

00:02:16.799 --> 00:02:18.801
at higher rates than others

00:02:18.843 --> 00:02:21.888
due to living in air-polluted communities.

00:02:22.763 --> 00:02:24.182
Now, that's not a surprise

00:02:24.182 --> 00:02:27.185
since the majority of people
who live in areas

00:02:27.226 --> 00:02:29.478
that do not meet clean air standards

00:02:29.520 --> 00:02:31.647
are Latinos and Black Americans.